# Vendored PQClean ML-KEM-768

Source: https://github.com/PQClean/PQClean

Commit: `202a8f96315f9ed219387a50f7e40d04af037ea8`

Vendored on: 2026-06-10

Only the portable `crypto_kem/ml-kem-768/clean` implementation and its required
`common` headers/Keccak implementation are included. The implementation license
is CC0/public domain; see `crypto_kem/ml-kem-768/clean/LICENSE`.

The local integration changes `kem.c` only to propagate failure from
`randombytes()` and to clear its temporary randomness. Randomness is provided by
the module's approved Hash_DRBG through `lib/mlkem_randombytes.c`.
